	(text_box "U22 LP5907-2.85 from +3V3_VTX (TI SNVS798): HD mode removes PA_VREF with the rail. EN = PA_EN straight from ESP32 GPIO2 (strap: internal 45k pull-down + the LP5907 1 MOhm EN pull-down). C123 4.7 uF 0402 (> 0.7 uF effective). CIN = C122 4.7 uF 0402 X5R at U22 IN (about 2.6 uF at 3.3 V, >= 2 uF at -20 % and hot): LP5907 DS 5.6 / 7.2.2.4 needs > 0.7 uF effective over all conditions within 1 cm; the 1 uF 0201 (about 0.45 uF) alone missed it (P4 critique r3).\nDEVIATIONS, bench-gated: (a) VREF window: 2.85 V +-2 % = 2.79-2.91 V vs SE5004L VREF H 2.80-2.90 V, and the +-2 % is specified only for VIN >= VOUT + 1 V (VIN here 3.3 V): V5 measures PA_VREF on several units, cold and hot. (b) HD switch-on with ELRS holding PA_EN high: +3V3_VTX collapses before C123 discharges, so VOUT exceeds VIN + 0.3 V (LP5907 abs max, DS 5.1) by up to one body-diode drop (<= 0.7 V, < 1 ms, <= 10 uJ from C123): V9 scopes PA_VREF and +3V3_VTX (< 0.5 V). Fallbacks: C123 down to 1 uF, or the patched ELRS drops PA_EN on HD_EN."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 158.75 0)
		(size 111.76 25.66)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "13f3de22-71bb-5e9f-bd38-b143648a6555")
	)
	(text_box "U21 LP5912-3.3 on +5V; CIN = the shared 10 uF C13 on POWER (BR-14) only if P5 puts C13 within 1 cm of the U21 IN pin (LP5912 DS 9.2.2.2; tools/check_p5_conditions.py), else U21 gets its own 10 uF 0402 CIN (GRM155C80J106ME11D). EN = VTX_PWR_EN: R68 47k to +3V3 (stock ELRS runs the VTX); R84 1k from ESP32 GPIO21 (patched-ELRS power-down hook): GPIO21 low gives VEN 0.07 V < VEN(OFF) 0.3 V; Q28 AP1606 drain = HD gate (HD_EN high: <= 220 mOhm at VGS 2.5 V sinks 70 uA, 3.3 mA with GPIO21 high, VEN < 1 mV). Hot margin (P4 r4, R68 was 100k): EN stays >= VEN(ON) 1.3 V max up to 42 uA of Q28 leakage (100k: 20 uA); AP1606 IDSS <= 1 uA at 25 C, <= 100 uA at 125 C (VDS 20 V), about 16 uA at 85 C. HD_EN before Betaflight drives PINIO1: <= 0.22 V vs VGS(th) 0.4 V min at 25 C (250 uA), about 0.25 V at 85 C (-2.5 mV/K): a hot low-Vth part may keep the VTX off until PINIO1 is driven low (V9 hot-soak boot check). COUT on +3V3_VTX: C108 10u + C121 1u + C122 4.7u + 3x 100n + 2x 100p = 16.0 uF nominal, about 6.8 uF effective at 3.3 V typical (5.4-8.2 uF at -/+20 %; POWER-sheet DC-bias figures), inside the LP5912 0.7-10 uF window. C108 sits at the RTC6705 VCO pins 39/40 (VCO bulk). Load 0.10 A typical, about 0.17 A at the top PA step (root power table)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 86.36 0)
		(size 111.76 27.72)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2dab5148-fcea-596e-bbc5-a92175f5e2e5")
	)
	(text_box "PA DETECTOR + NTC (spec 4.8). DET (0.325 V no RF .. 1.0 V at 27 dBm) -> PA_DET_RAW -> R66 1k / C117 100p -> PA_DET (ESP32 GPIO4, ADC2); the trace crosses sides, keep the RC at the ESP32 end of R66. TH1 NCP03XH103F05RL in the PA ring + R70 10k from +3V3 -> PA_NTC (GPIO34, ADC1, input only): 1.65 V at 25 C. BPF + U.FL: FL2 Walsin RFBPF1608060K98Q1C on the PA side away from the PA body (power handling at 0.71 W: open item O7); J1 U.FL with L2 cut out under the signal pad (RF_PAD_CUTOUT), >= 4 GND vias at the tabs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 205.07 0)
		(size 170.18 11.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "3aaaa757-c5be-52bc-9e4f-5bd5a60a8d95")
	)
	(text_box "SE5004L PA (Skyworks 202393B + EK1). RFout has an internal DC shunt to GND and only RFin is marked 'DC block required'; the BPF, U.FL and antenna carry no DC, so RFout -> FL2 directly (internal output match, no match parts on the line; P5 EM-checks the line). PA_VCC = R67 selector: one 0402 0R from COM to +BATT (default, pads 1-2) or +5V (pads 2-3, hand rework); the footprint anchor is the pad 1-2 midpoint, so the CPL centres the default part. VCC1/VCC2 <= VCC3 holds (one net). EK1 decoupling: 1n + 100p at 8/9, at 18/19 and at 20, on both package sides, + C118 10 uF shared, no ferrite. VREF from PA_VREF (abs max 3.6 V). SP1/SP2 (optional EVM caps) open; NU (open in the package) tied to GND: it lies in the DS ground metal. EP + pins 2, 4, 11, 12, 14-17 to GND with a via field."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 307.34 190.5 0)
		(size 170.18 13.3)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "676f6fac-2d4f-53de-ab5a-f4091824023a")
	)
	(text_box "VIDEO + LOOP FILTER (OpenOSD-X v1.01). VIDEO_OUT (OSD switch; 75R camera termination on the OSD sheet) -> R58 1.2k || C104 33p -> R59 270R shunt -> C105 4.7u -> R60 1.2k -> VT_MOD, bias R61 510k / R62 560k from +3V3_VTX (1.73 V) = OpenOSD-X R24 C17 R25 C21 R29 R30 R31. Load seen at VIDEO_OUT: 1.47 kOhm DC (R58 + R59), about 0.95 kOhm at 5 MHz and 0.60 kOhm at 10 MHz (R58 / C104 4.0 MHz, R59-loaded 21.9 MHz; 270R only above about 20 MHz, outside the video band); the OSD level note uses it. Loop filter = OpenOSD-X: CP -> R63 100k -> VT; VT -> C106 1u and R64 47k + C107 4.7u to GND. RTC_CP / RTC_VT / RTC_LF and VT_MOD* are high-impedance nodes (Analog net class): short copper, >= 5 mm from the boost and the ESC phases."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 217.58 0)
		(size 160.02 13.3)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6be002d0-840e-5af6-befc-ebe1955347e1")
	)
	(text_box "PNP PA DRIVE. ESP32 GPIO13 VTX_AMP_PWM (ELRS vtx_amp_pwm, 10 kHz) -> two RC poles (R71 / C124, R72 / C125, 1k / 1u each) -> BC857BM base; emitter R73 (Re) to +3V3_VTX; collector Q27_C -> R65 10R -> PAOUT1_SUP -> L3 -> RTC6705 PAOUT1: it sets the RTC6705 output-stage current, not the SE5004L bias. Inverting, current mode. ngspice (Nexperia BC857BM model, PAOUT1 sink model): Re 10R gives 32-59 mA at the top step over hFE 220-475 and -20..85 C, Q27 <= 114 mW (Ptot 130 mW at 85 C), base ripple 2.1 mV p-p, settles in 8 ms (ELRS 20 ms loop). GPIO13 after reset is an input with the internal pull-down (ESP32 DS IO_MUX: oe=0, ie=1, wpd; about 45 kOhm): ngspice case 4 gives 10-19 mA (Re 10R) from reset until ELRS initialize() sets the pit count (stock vtxSPIPWM = MAX_PWM), and for as long as the ESP32 stays in ROM download mode (SW1 held, recovery): Q27 about 50 mW, the PA off (GPIO2 wpd), V5 measures that boot leakage at the U.FL. HD mode: both junctions reverse-biased 3.3 V (VEBO 5 V). Steps per 6 dB at Re 10R: 11-13 at 1 mA, 16-19 at 2 mA, 25-32 at 4 mA; V8 measures the PAOUT1 current at 25 mW and V5 sets Re (27R gives >= 20 steps from 1.5 mA). Start value R73 = 10R.\nRATINGS AT THE TOP STEP (Re 10R, hFE 475, 85 C: 58.5 mA): R73 and R65 dissipate about 34 mW each, against the RC0201 derating (50 mW to 70 C, zero at 125 C: 36 mW at 85 C, 27 mW at 95 C) beside a 2 W PA; Q27 <= 114 mW against 130 mW at 85 C (12 % margin). V8 pass: top-step current and the board temperature at R73 / R65 / Q27 keep each part inside its derated rating; levers: cap the ELRS power-table top count so Ic <= 45 mA (P <= 20 mW), or Re 27R (26 mW in R73, 10 mW in R65) if V5 accepts the steps; 0402s only if V8 shows the top step is needed."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 232.15 0)
		(size 160.02 29.78)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "9f627506-f93b-5e1c-9d3e-c71fbe308da2")
	)
	(text_box "RTC6705, checked pin by pin against OpenOSD-X v1.01: 23 REG1D8_1 -> C96 470n (= ref); 26 REG1D8 open (ref DNI); 17 AVDD_6.5 open (ref 3.3k + 1u, no 3.3 V; V5 checks for a 6.5 MHz spur); 31/32 BUFVDD/PAVDD -> +3V3_VTX with C103 100p + C101 100n shared with 30; 40 LDD2V5 -> +3V3_VTX direct with C102 100p (ref 51R + 1u filter; V5 video SNR); 39 VCOVDD with C102 + the 10 uF C108 placed there (ref 4.7u); 8/9 C98, 22 C100. Open: 1 SPI_SE (internal pull-up = SPI mode), 2-4, 11-16 (11 RF_VT2 audio input: V5 spur check), 18-21, 34, 36, 37. X4 exactly 8 MHz (ELRS R = 400), CL 10 pF = 15p + 15p in series + about 2.5 pF stray."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 190.5 0)
		(size 160.02 13.3)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width -0.0001)
			(type solid)
