			(type solid)
		)
		(fill
			(type none)
		)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b0089bc5-e8a3-5b94-8575-d9ad95b9ab53")
	)
	(text_box "VTX SPI (PINMAP F21). R80 / R81 / R82 1k in series with CS / CLK / DATA, drawn here and PLACED AT THE ESP32 END of each line (bom_plan): they limit back-feed into the unpowered RTC6705 in HD mode (<= 2.7 mA per high line; CS idles high -> +3V3_VTX about 0.27 V on the LP5912 100 Ohm active discharge, V9 limit 0.5 V; writes only at frequency changes). ELRS HSPI 1 MHz, mode 0, LSB first: tau = 1k x about 12 pF = 12 ns (26 ns 10-90 %) against >= 20 ns setup / hold in a 500 ns half period; the same RC on all three lines. SPIDATA is bidirectional (3-wire reads through R82, production test)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.7 205.07 0)
		(size 160.02 11.24)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
