		(property "Description" "5.8 GHz FM video/audio transmitter (PLL synthesiser + VCO + driver), 3-wire SPI (SPI_SE high) or channel pins, QFN-40 6x6 mm, EP (41) = GND. Data-sheet NC pins 2, 12, 18, 36, 37 omitted (no internal connection; trimmed in the _Dense footprint). PAOUT1 +2 dBm / PAOUT2 +13 dBm outputs; REG1D8/REG1D8_1 are internal 1.8 V regulator outputs for decoupling only. RTC6705A is pin compatible"
